{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1794498798,"nonce":"sp+7+urvBp/ofqnD92L5CN/e71s=","message":"Landed on `roadmap-190c308-integration` (065801e..f6d9b58).\n\n**Changes**\n- Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock: add arboard 3.7.0\n- src/ui/paste.rs (new): paste-instead flow. Gemini extraction via extraction_request, parse_extraction and extraction_into_product. Text read from the clipboard, image read via arboard and PNG-encoded, dropped image files (png/jpg/webp, max 10 MB) targeted at the paste-mode row. 19 tests.\n- src/ui/mod.rs: new messages PasteMode, PasteText, PasteImage, FileDropped, PastedText, PastedImage, Extracted. New ItemState.paste_error and App.paste_row. Window file-drop subscription.\n- src/ui/input.rs: failed row now has Retry and \"Pegar en su lugar\". Paste mode opens a hint plus Paste text / Paste image buttons and shows paste errors. Compare and row removal are blocked while a row is extracting. paste_row is kept in step when rows are removed.\n- src/i18n.rs: 8 ES/EN keys for the paste UI.\n- src/ui/snap.rs, scripts/snap.sh: MAEVE_FAILED dev flag, and a -failed snapshot per theme and language.\n\n**Gates:** fmt ok · clippy ok · tests ok (199 passed) · scraper-tests n/a\n**Review:** 3 findings — 1 auto, 1 by hand, 1 deferred (dropped false-positive not counted)\n- Retry button stays enabled but silently does nothing while another row is extracting. It is cosmetic, because can_compare already blocks the run.\n\n**Decisions**\n- Extracted(i, Ok(Box\u003cProduct\u003e)) applies only while the row is Extracting, so a late reply for an edited or re-scraped row is dropped. The scan flagged the earlier Failed arm, and I removed it.\n- PastedText and PastedImage apply only if paste_row == Some(i). Row removal shifts paste_row, so a stale index is dropped. This fixes the scan's shifted-row finding without a new flag.\n- Paste is offered only for failures that are not ScrapeErrorKind::Unsupported, because there is no site to extract for.\n- Extraction uses settings.advocate_model and does not use pipeline retry. On failure the row returns to Failed with \"No se pudo extraer el producto: \u003cerr\u003e\", and paste mode stays available.\n- A successful extraction sets stale when a result exists, so Rerun includes the new product.\n- Retry is unchanged from L3. It reuses Ready products and re-scrapes every non-Ready row, not strictly the single item.\n- The 4 failed-row snapshots (light/dark x es/en) were reviewed and look correct. Manual check of a pasted TEMU screenshot against live Gemini was not run, because it needs a real API key.","files":null}]}